    "L3-0080": {"glose": "occasion, circonstance", "acceptions": [["N", "occasion, circonstance, situation"]], "exemples": [["在这种场合不能穿短裤。", "Zài zhè zhǒng chǎnghé bù néng chuān duǎnkù.", "Dans ce genre de situation, on ne met pas de short."]]},
